---
/**
 * Grade de amostras de cor — os 31 tokens `--color-*` do `@theme`, um a um.
 *
 * Renderizado DUAS vezes por `TokensColor.astro`: uma herdando o tema da página, outra dentro de
 * um `data-theme="dark"`. Por isso este arquivo não tem NENHUM `id` e nenhum `<h*>`: os dois usos
 * conviveriam no mesmo documento e duplicariam ambos. Rótulo de grupo sai em `<p class="label">`,
 * que é andaime de demonstração, não estrutura de cabeçalho.
 *
 * POR QUE CADA CLASSE ESTÁ ESCRITA POR EXTENSO, e não gerada a partir de uma lista de nomes:
 * `scripts/check-utilities.mjs` só enxerga o que está DENTRO de um atributo `class=`. Uma classe
 * montada (`class={`bg-${token}`}`) escapa das duas travas — e como o Tailwind v4 varre o arquivo
 * cru, ele ainda geraria o CSS a partir do literal solto, então um typo não quebraria o build:
 * viraria no-op silencioso, exatamente o buraco que a trava B existe pra fechar. Verbosidade aqui
 * é o preço de a grade inteira ser verificada.
 *
 * A amostra é um quadrado de `size-target` (52px, o mesmo alvo de toque do sistema) com borda
 * `line-soft` — sem a borda, `bg`, `surface` e `field-bg` desapareceriam contra o fundo da página
 * no tema claro, que é justamente quando a diferença entre eles importa.
 */
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Superfícies</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-bg"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >bg<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">fundo da página</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-surface"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >surface<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">card e painel</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-surface-alt"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >surface-alt<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">faixa creme</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-surface-brand"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >surface-brand<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">manifesto e CTA</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-surface-deep"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >surface-deep<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">rodapé e CTA escuro</span></span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Linhas</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-line"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >line<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">borda padrão de controle</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-line-strong"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >line-strong<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">régua de abertura de seção</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-line-soft"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >line-soft<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">divisória discreta</span></span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Texto</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink">ink<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">título</span></span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-body"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-body<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">texto corrido</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-muted"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-muted<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">meta e rótulo</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-on-brand"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-on-brand<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">único texto sobre surface-brand</span
          ></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-on-deep"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-on-deep<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">texto sobre surface-deep</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-on-deep-2"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-on-deep-2<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">secundário sobre deep</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-ink-on-deep-3"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >ink-on-deep-3<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">meta sobre deep</span></span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Marca</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-brand"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >brand<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">link e texto de marca</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-brand-tint"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >brand-tint<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">fundo de hover e foco</span></span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Ação</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-accent"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >accent<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">fundo da ação principal</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-accent-hover"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >accent-hover<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">mesma ação, sob o cursor</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-on-accent"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >on-accent<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">texto sobre accent</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-accent-deep"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >accent-deep<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">ação sobre fundo escuro</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-on-accent-deep"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >on-accent-deep<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">texto sobre accent-deep</span></span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label text-ink-muted">Estado</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-focus-ring"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >focus-ring<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">anel de foco</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span
          class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-focus-ring-on-dark"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >focus-ring-on-dark<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">o mesmo anel, em bloco escuro</span
          ></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-focus-halo"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >focus-halo<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">reforço supletivo do anel</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-error"></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >error<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">mensagem e borda de erro</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-error-bg"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >error-bg<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">fundo do resumo de erro</span></span
        >
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="size-target shrink-0 rounded-control border border-line-soft bg-disabled-bg"
        ></span>
        <span class="text-small text-ink"
          >disabled-bg<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">fundo de controle inativo</span></span
